  "instructions": [
    {
      "primary_message": "Drain and small dice peaches. Place in a small bowl.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "1 (15 oz) can sliced peaches in juice"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Wash, dry, and zest lemon into the bowl with the peaches. Add honey and cinnamon, then stir to combine. (Reserve lemon for another use.)\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "½ lemon\n½ tbsp honey\n¼ tsp cinnamon, ground"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Place cottage cheese, additional honey, and salt in a food processor. Blend on high until mixture is completely smooth, scraping down the sides of the processor with a silicone spatula as needed, 1-2 minutes. \n\n",
      "secondary_message": "3 cups cottage cheese\n2 ½ tbsp honey\n1 pinch salt"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Add half of the peach mixture to the processor, then pulse 5-7 times to combine. Divide pudding between four ramekins or glasses, smoothing the tops flat with the back of a spoon. Cover and chill for 1 hour. (Refrigerate remaining peach mixture for serving.)\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "To serve, top puddings with reserved peaches and enjoy!\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    }
  ],
